DATABASE DESIGN — SAP ABAP PURCHASE ORDER MANAGEMENT SYSTEM

Z25VENDOR — Vendor Master
MANDT (key), VENDOR_ID (key), VENDOR_NAME, CITY, EMAIL.

Z25MATERIAL — Material Master
MANDT (key), MATERIAL_ID (key), MATERIAL_NAME, UNIT, PRICE, CURRENCY.

Z25VENDOR_MAT1 — Vendor-Material Relationship
MANDT (key), VENDOR_ID (key), MATERIAL_ID (key).
Stores permitted vendor/material pairs.

Z25PO_HEADER — Purchase Order Header
MANDT (key), PO_ID (key), VENDOR_ID, PO_DATE, DELIVERY_DATE, CURRENCY, TOTAL_AMOUNT, STATUS.

Z25PO_ITEM — Purchase Order Items
MANDT (key), PO_ID (key), ITEM_NO (key), MATERIAL_ID, QUANTITY, UNIT, UNIT_PRICE, LINE_TOTAL, CURRENCY.

PRIMARY KEYS
Z25VENDOR: MANDT + VENDOR_ID
Z25MATERIAL: MANDT + MATERIAL_ID
Z25VENDOR_MAT1: MANDT + VENDOR_ID + MATERIAL_ID
Z25PO_HEADER: MANDT + PO_ID
Z25PO_ITEM: MANDT + PO_ID + ITEM_NO

LOGICAL RELATIONSHIPS
Vendor to PO Header through VENDOR_ID.
PO Header to PO Item through PO_ID.
Material to PO Item through MATERIAL_ID.
Vendor and Material to Z25VENDOR_MAT1 through VENDOR_ID and MATERIAL_ID.

DATA INTEGRITY
Vendor and material should exist; vendor/material pair must be registered; quantity must be positive; delivery date must not precede PO date; item number must be unique within a PO; header total should equal sum of item line totals.

Verify active field definitions and currency/quantity reference fields in SE11.
